{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a ferocious creature destroying entire dimensions without even trying, only the Dimensional Travelers are able to stand in it's way. Doller, a lazy apprentice Mage, is about to be sent on the adventure of a lifetime. Teaming up with the other Dimensional Travelers, Yeign; a Navish Warrior, Freia; a well mannered Demon Spawn, and Yosei; a Pixie Thief that will come at you if you call him a Fairy; and following the Commander's orders, can this misfit group really stop the destruction of the very fabric of the entire Universe?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>5 World Maps 230 x 178 blocks large and over 520 detailed maps in total</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Night and day cycles with the ability to break into buildings</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Different battles for the Dimensional Beast with happy and bad endings for each character</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Powerful storylines and character arcs causing dimensions to feel different</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Working PC in the Airship Cabin that has apps and fully working games\u00a0</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Table Top games you can play with NPCs and win prizes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>NPCs working and doing complicated tasks making each world feel alive</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>New Game Plus allows player to earn points to unlock advantages</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Amazing Original Sound Track by composer Anthony\u00a0Fusilier</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Extras:</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Laurel's Day - RPG on the PC where you follow Laurel through her school day</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laurel's Locket - Beating Laurel's Day unlocks Laurel's Locket in Dimensional Gates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Imminent Distress - Survival on the PC where you're stranded on a dangerous planet</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crystal Pick - Beating Imminent Distress unlocks Crystal Pick in Dimensional Gates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Knixer's Revenge - Original table top game you can play with NPCs</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Camping Gear - Beating Knixer's Revenge unlocks the Camping Gear in Dimensional Gates</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>16 Usable Icons of characters from the game</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being a solo dev project by a professional sci-fi/fantasy writer, Dimensional Gates is the next amazing adventure you're set to experience. With hours and hours of gameplay, storylines, and battling enemies, you can feel the heart and soul that was placed into the making of this game well.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>David Listzwan - &quot;I wanted to create something truly new, not just expand on existing AAA concepts. Dimensional Gates is a book you play, pushing the boundaries of what's possible in an RPG with fresh ideas like an in-game PC, unlockable vending machines, and impactful player choices. This game is my guarantee of a quality, immersive, and unforgettable adventure.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* <u>Game designed using RPG Maker MV Engine</u> (<strong><i>screen freeze issues fixed, flawless transfer to airship cabin, preloaded music for instant play, and minimal plugins for smooth gameplay and minimal loading</i></strong>)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3636130?t=1764657863","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636130/51f7e643abf625c1110182c84e78ed919c35d7f9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764657863","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636130/14cb4770f9713ff487a849a913bc0b129e7d6d9b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764657863","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636130/14cb4770f9713ff487a849a913bc0b129e7d6d9b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764657863","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Strong mature themes such as slavery, death, murder, mass destruction, fascism, genocide, and kidnapping\r\n\r\nTypical 2D RPG pixel art violence and guns\r\n\r\nSome items use Alcohol\r\n\r\nRemoving all armor and weapons option is called 'Naked' and the image of the character shows underwear instead of armor\r\n\r\n\r\nLaurel's Day:\r\n\r\nStrong mature themes such as death, psychological break down; with classroom lessons on systematic slavery, human trafficking, fascism, and Stalinism"},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3638610,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Collector's Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Collector's Edition will include the amazing Original Sound Track by Anthony Fusilier, the Collector's Edition of Laurel's Day, the Table Top gaming backroom, videos with the developer David Listzwan to congratulate you on your new journey, and the Collector's Edition of Imminent Distress once it releases.\u00a0<br><br>Not Allowed to Die Gaming Studios promises even though this Collector's Edition is full of so many goodies, we are going to keep the price as minimal as we can. We are aiming for it to be priced around the same as the amazing sound track Anthony has made for this game. We want the Collector's Edition to be a steal for anyone interested and well worth any upgrade price it may have.\u00a0</p></p><br><h1>Important Game Controls</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For those not familiar with RPG Maker titles, there are a few things to know:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F4 - Full Screen Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F5 - Restart Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Steam Overlay can leave images in the black border of the game's engine, using F4 to leave full screen and return will clean that up. Sorry for the inconvenience, but it's a glitch in the overlay.</i></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a ferocious creature destroying entire dimensions without even trying, only the Dimensional Travelers are able to stand in it's way. Doller, a lazy apprentice Mage, is about to be sent on the adventure of a lifetime. Teaming up with the other Dimensional Travelers, Yeign; a Navish Warrior, Freia; a well mannered Demon Spawn, and Yosei; a Pixie Thief that will come at you if you call him a Fairy; and following the Commander's orders, can this misfit group really stop the destruction of the very fabric of the entire Universe?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>5 World Maps 230 x 178 blocks large and over 520 detailed maps in total</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Night and day cycles with the ability to break into buildings</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Different battles for the Dimensional Beast with happy and bad endings for each character</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Powerful storylines and character arcs causing dimensions to feel different</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Working PC in the Airship Cabin that has apps and fully working games\u00a0</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Table Top games you can play with NPCs and win prizes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>NPCs working and doing complicated tasks making each world feel alive</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>New Game Plus allows player to earn points to unlock advantages</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Amazing Original Sound Track by composer Anthony\u00a0Fusilier</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Extras:</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Laurel's Day - RPG on the PC where you follow Laurel through her school day</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laurel's Locket - Beating Laurel's Day unlocks Laurel's Locket in Dimensional Gates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Imminent Distress - Survival on the PC where you're stranded on a dangerous planet</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crystal Pick - Beating Imminent Distress unlocks Crystal Pick in Dimensional Gates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Knixer's Revenge - Original table top game you can play with NPCs</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Camping Gear - Beating Knixer's Revenge unlocks the Camping Gear in Dimensional Gates</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>16 Usable Icons of characters from the game</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being a solo dev project by a professional sci-fi/fantasy writer, Dimensional Gates is the next amazing adventure you're set to experience. With hours and hours of gameplay, storylines, and battling enemies, you can feel the heart and soul that was placed into the making of this game well.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>David Listzwan - &quot;I wanted to create something truly new, not just expand on existing AAA concepts. Dimensional Gates is a book you play, pushing the boundaries of what's possible in an RPG with fresh ideas like an in-game PC, unlockable vending machines, and impactful player choices. This game is my guarantee of a quality, immersive, and unforgettable adventure.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* <u>Game designed using RPG Maker MV Engine</u> (<strong><i>screen freeze issues fixed, flawless transfer to airship cabin, preloaded music for instant play, and minimal plugins for smooth gameplay and minimal loading</i></strong>)</p>","developers":["David Listzwan"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636130/d9b3c49d3833e7167fab935461ba7957696baee0/header.jpg?t=1764657863","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"*Any duplication of any characters, events, or ideas is prohibited. All rights are reserved by the author David Scott Listzwan.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n**This is a work of fiction. Names, characters, places, events and incidents are the products of the author's imagination and are used in a fictitious manner. Any resemblance to actual persons, living or dead, or actual events is purely coincidental. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n***Original music is the work of AF Studio and any duplication is prohibited. All rights are reserved by the composer Anthony Fusilier.","linux_req